menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_FAMILY_LINKAGE
    bool "Enable family linkage, device groups and content sync"
    default n
    help
        Runs the bounded family-linkage policy, evaluates message routing scope
        and resolves content-sync conflicts by version. A lone device is a valid
        family of one, so a body without a second device simply does not link
        the component.

endmenu
